Description: animated microscopic life in your terminal
 Watch immune cells engulf microbes, bacteria divide, and phages replicate in
 a living terminal microscope slide. Includes diverse organisms, rare events,
 optional mouse and keyboard tools, and plain-text snapshots.
 .
 This is biological illustration with exaggerated sizes and timing, rather
 than a scientific model.
